  monthly:["Review site risk assessment and operating capacity","Review incidents, near misses, complaints and corrective actions","Audit equipment inventory against physical stock","Review equipment maintenance, retirement and replacement decisions","Review cashbook against receipts, bank/card statements and booking totals","Review bookings, attendance, revenue per player and repeat-visit rate","Review marketing performance and social content results","Review staff training, first-aid competency and role coverage","Run and record an emergency response / evacuation practice","Review privacy, photo consent, waivers and retention of player records","Review permits, licences, insurance and renewal dates","Approve next month's game calendar, promotions and maintenance budget"]
